---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '@components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service — Bill Leece">
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-bg-primary text-color-main">
    <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto px-[16px] pt-[24px] pb-[64px]">
      <header class="flex items-center justify-between py-[16px]">
        <a href="/" class="font-serif font-semibold text-h6 lg:text-h5 text-color-main"
          >Bill Leece</a
        >
      </header>

      <h1 class="font-serif font-semibold text-h3 lg:text-h2 mt-[24px]">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-h7 mt-[8px]">Last updated: September 20, 2026</p>

      <div class="mt-[32px] flex flex-col gap-y-[28px]">
        <section>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-h6 leading-relaxed">
            These terms cover alunex.ai, including the Insider Trading Signals tool at
            <a href="/insider-trading-signals" class="text-accent-blue underline">/insider-trading-signals</a>.
            This is a personal site and a free tool, not a company selling a product, so
            these are plain terms rather than a dense legal contract &mdash; if anything
            here is unclear, email me (see <a href="/privacy" class="text-accent-blue underline">Privacy Policy</a>) and ask.
            By using this site, you agree to these terms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif font-semibold text-h5">Not investment advice</h2>
          <p class="mt-[10px] text-text-secondary text-h6 leading-relaxed">
            Insider Trading Signals surfaces publicly disclosed SEC and Congressional
            filings &mdash; nothing on this site is a recommendation to buy, sell, or hold
            any security. I'm not a registered investment adviser or broker-dealer, and
            this isn't a substitute for your own research or a licensed advisor. Any
            investment decision you make is yours alone, and you're responsible for the
            outcome.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif font-semibold text-h5">Data accuracy</h2>
          <p class="mt-[10px] text-text-secondary text-h6 leading-relaxed">
            The data here comes from public filings (SEC Form 4s, Senate financial
            disclosures), parsed and aggregated automatically. I try to keep it accurate
            and current, but I don't guarantee it's complete, error-free, or up to the
            second &mdash; always check the primary source before relying on anything
            shown here.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif font-semibold text-h5">Your account</h2>
          <p class="mt-[10px] text-text-secondary text-h6 leading-relaxed">
            Signing in and saving a watchlist is optional and free. You're responsible for
            keeping access to your Google account secure &mdash; that's what controls
            sign-in here. You can stop using the site, sign out, or ask me to delete your
            account and watchlist data at any time (see the
            <a href="/privacy" class="text-accent-blue underline">Privacy Policy</a> for how).
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif font-semibold text-h5">Acceptable use</h2>
          <p class="mt-[10px] text-text-secondary text-h6 leading-relaxed">
            Use the site for its intended purpose &mdash; viewing and tracking public
            filing data. Don't try to disrupt the site, scrape it at a scale that degrades
            it for others, or use it for any unlawful purpose.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif font-semibold text-h5">No warranty, limitation of liability</h2>
          <p class="mt-[10px] text-text-secondary text-h6 leading-relaxed">
            This site is provided "as is," with no warranty of any kind, including that
            it will be available, uninterrupted, or error-free. To the fullest extent the
            law allows, I'm not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of
            this site or reliance on anything it shows &mdash; including investment
            losses.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif font-semibold text-h5">Changes</h2>
          <p class="mt-[10px] text-text-secondary text-h6 leading-relaxed">
            I may change these terms, the site, or the tool itself (including pausing or
            discontinuing it) at any time. If the terms change, I'll update this page and
            the date at the top.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif font-semibold text-h5">Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-[10px] text-text-secondary text-h6 leading-relaxed">
            Questions about these terms? Email
            <a href="mailto:bill@alunex.ai" class="text-accent-blue underline">bill@alunex.ai</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
    <Footer />
  </div>
</Layout>
